# Real fetched source documents for the laundering probe (copyright: analysis, not
# redistribution). The committed PROVENANCE.md records URL + retrieval date + verbatim
# snippet so the source can be recreated; see examples/destructive/laundering/.
examples/destructive/laundering/sources/

# Persisted Tier-2 calibration chains (raw assay output; attribution summaries are committed)
/testing/chains/

# Raw fetched hearing transcripts for the LCEIC faithfulness analysis (copyright: analysis, not
# redistribution). The committed PROVENANCE.md records every URL + retrieval date; the derived
# report-summary.md / submissions-index.md / claims-machine.txt are tracked. See examples/vic-lceic/.
# Exclude the corpus contents (not the dir itself), so the MANIFEST can be re-included — git cannot
# un-ignore a file whose parent directory is excluded.
examples/vic-lceic/sources/*
# ...but the corpus MANIFEST (document names + ids, no copyrighted text) is a tracked artifact.
!examples/vic-lceic/sources/MANIFEST.md

